# MediaPipe FaceLandmarker weights (3.8 MB). Google-hosted and re-downloadable, so it is
# fetched rather than committed -- same treatment as the large ONNX checkpoints above.
# Pin the version: a different landmarker revision shifts landmark positions slightly, which
# moves every derived measurement the geometry model was fitted on.
#   https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/face_landmarker/face_landmarker/float16/1/face_landmarker.task
training/engagenet/face_landmarker.task
